  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量本地推-本地推\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量本地推\"],\"capability_summary\":\"根据本地推投放账户ID、营销目的等条件筛选可投门店列表，支持按门店名称、ID、省份、城市、商品ID等进行筛选，同时支持分页查询。适用场景为本地推投放时选择可投门店。关键配合接口有【获取Access token】和【获取行政信息】。\",\"id\":\"local.poi.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/local/poi/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"1807977760174122\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用本接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"get.administrative_info\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad\\u0026type=api\\u0026id=1709606596424718\",\"reason\":\"可通过该接口获取省份和城市的ID用于筛选门店\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取行政信息\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"1807977760174122\",\"title\":\"获取可投门店列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\">\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201805612619030540%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-EKf8WPOC\" id=\"h346b9f0-EKf8WPOC\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-6f4PgN7D\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/local/poi/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/local/poi/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1807977760174122\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-amW36050\" id=\"h346b9f0-amW36050\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-pKBjcQ2G\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-cjCg9TFF\" id=\"h346b9f0-cjCg9TFF\">请求Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CfTXQsqF\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-RjIbZEEJ\" id=\"h346b9f0-RjIbZEEJ\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">local_account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4aFk6Y5d\">本地推投放账户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">local_delivery_scene</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dBhfOZvp\">项目设置的营销目的，根据营销目的筛选可投门店列表，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-8hWGbBTM\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WZD95el2\"><code>CONTENT_HEAT</code> 线上互动</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7nI0CaUk\"><code>POI_RECOMMEND</code> 线下到店</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-D7a1rILq\"><code>PRODUCT_PAY</code> 团购成交</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cQKffK9L\"><code>EXTERNAL</code> 获取线索</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oiWIJDJG\">过滤器</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">search_key_word</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vXWg4bh0\">根据门店名称/门店ID筛选，门店名称支持模糊搜索，门店ID支持精确搜索。</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">province</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WP4hsR07\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"></span><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">根据门店所在省份id筛选，ID可通过</span><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1709606596424718\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">【获取行政信息】</span></a><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">接口获取</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">city</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1uU0moJg\">根据门店所在城市id筛选，ID可<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">通过</span><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1709606596424718\" target=\"_blank\">【获取行政信息】</a><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">接口获取</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">product_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aadERKHU\">通过商品ID筛选商品适用门店，当需要获取商品适用门店时传入</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-3eIl7C64\">创编使用场景：当商品投放并使用门店附近定向时，需传入门店id且仅支持设置商品适用门店附近，可通过该字段获取商品适用门店列表</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-m4bIHfHh\">页码，默认值<code>1</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DGkr0HiF\">页面大小，<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">默认值</span><code>20</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">，取值范围</span><code>1-100</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-VfT81P5o\" id=\"h346b9f0-VfT81P5o\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Flocal%2Fpoi%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20local_account